## Development Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/UserJoo9/WiFi-Nightmare.git
cd WiFi-Nightmare
sudo apt-get install aircrack-ng hcxtools iw hostapd dnsmasq reaver pixiewps
pip install -e .
sudo wifi-nightmare wlan0
```

**Run tests:**
```bash
pip install pytest && python3 -m pytest tests/
```

